Wait, what?

Why would you ever use lightning as a weapon?  Not only does it destroy
rings and wands, as you note, it also blinds monsters and renders your 
perfectly good Elbereth worthless.

No, no.  Wands of fire and lightning should be only used as weapons in
an absolute last resort, and certainly NEVER against a monster that
respects Elbereth.

Those wands are, to me, X charges of portable, single-turn, burned-in (and
thus near-permanent) Elbereth.  Way better than scare monster.

